{
  "_comment": "LTX 2.5 reference->video via the Licon MSR stack (liconstudio/ComfyUI-LTX2.5-MSR + the LTX-2.5-Licon-MSR-V1 IC-LoRA): up to four subject references plus a DEDICATED background slot, each independently encoded with a learned slot embedding and prepended to the video latent at negative temporal offsets. LTXVCropGuides strips those reference frames back off before the upsample and before decode. Unlike the source (vrgamedevgirl) workflow this variant GENERATES its audio (empty audio latent through both passes, decoded at the end) rather than locking an input track. resolve._wire_msr_refs adds LoadImage nodes and the pic1..pic4/background links on BOTH guide nodes at run time — the guide's pics are optional inputs, so the template ships none. Pass-1 guider reads the guide's wrapped conditioning; pass 2 re-guides the upscaled latent and applies LTXVConditioning after, mirroring the working source graph.",
